{"video_id":"_x3MdDm_19A","title":"Julia Diament: Cyber Offense Hits Its Moore’s Law Moment","conference":"the-ai-conference","language":"en","auto_generated":true,"source":"supa","timing":"exact","word_count":2555,"segments":[{"start":5.52,"duration":4.88,"text":"Hey everyone. I'm Julia Diamante,"},{"start":8.0,"duration":5.84,"text":"principal AI architect in Microsoft"},{"start":10.4,"duration":5.64,"text":"security office of the CDO."},{"start":13.84,"duration":5.32,"text":"I'm a huge believer in the adversarial"},{"start":16.04,"duration":5.52,"text":"approach, not just building defenses,"},{"start":19.16,"duration":5.68,"text":"but constantly challenging our"},{"start":21.56,"duration":7.28,"text":"assumption, trying to break things,"},{"start":24.84,"duration":5.52,"text":"and to understand how attackers think."},{"start":28.84,"duration":3.96,"text":"Because I believe"},{"start":30.36,"duration":7.04,"text":"the most useful way to truly understand"},{"start":32.8,"duration":7.52,"text":"a system is to try to defeat it."},{"start":37.4,"duration":5.0,"text":"Now, there is one absolute rule in"},{"start":40.32,"duration":3.92,"text":"cybersecurity"},{"start":42.4,"duration":3.48,"text":"that every presentation has to be in"},{"start":44.24,"duration":3.32,"text":"black."},{"start":45.88,"duration":4.04,"text":"And the conference gave us this"},{"start":47.56,"duration":5.44,"text":"beautiful purple template,"},{"start":49.92,"duration":5.72,"text":"but I'm not going to use it."},{"start":53.0,"duration":5.08,"text":"So, from now on, things are going to get"},{"start":55.64,"duration":5.44,"text":"much darker."},{"start":58.08,"duration":5.28,"text":"But please do remember this purple color"},{"start":61.08,"duration":5.8,"text":"template."},{"start":63.36,"duration":5.68,"text":"And one quick disclaimer before we go,"},{"start":66.88,"duration":5.16,"text":"everything I will share with you today"},{"start":69.04,"duration":5.52,"text":"is my own theory and opinion. It doesn't"},{"start":72.04,"duration":5.32,"text":"represent Microsoft strategy,"},{"start":74.56,"duration":4.24,"text":"prediction, or road map."},{"start":77.36,"duration":4.24,"text":"Now,"},{"start":78.8,"duration":5.12,"text":"let's talk about how AI is changing"},{"start":81.6,"duration":5.0,"text":"cyber offense and what should we do"},{"start":83.92,"duration":2.68,"text":"about it."},{"start":89.12,"duration":4.24,"text":"I would like to start"},{"start":90.88,"duration":5.16,"text":"with a simple idea."},{"start":93.36,"duration":3.68,"text":"AI did more than improve offensive"},{"start":96.04,"duration":4.12,"text":"tools."},{"start":97.04,"duration":6.16,"text":"It repriced offensive tools. It repriced"},{"start":100.16,"duration":3.04,"text":"cyber offense."},{"start":103.24,"duration":5.12,"text":"The AI revolution became an economic"},{"start":106.84,"duration":3.52,"text":"revolution."},{"start":108.36,"duration":5.04,"text":"And I would like to"},{"start":110.36,"duration":4.28,"text":"examine this through three vectors. The"},{"start":113.4,"duration":5.44,"text":"first,"},{"start":114.64,"duration":6.16,"text":"agentic attack orchestrator. The second"},{"start":118.84,"duration":3.24,"text":"automa- autonomous"},{"start":120.8,"duration":3.88,"text":"vulnerability discovery and"},{"start":122.08,"duration":5.28,"text":"exploitation. And the third"},{"start":124.68,"duration":4.6,"text":"AI-driven persuasion, aka social"},{"start":127.36,"duration":4.84,"text":"engineering."},{"start":129.28,"duration":5.08,"text":"I will go briefly examine the first two"},{"start":132.2,"duration":4.0,"text":"and then deep dive into the third where"},{"start":134.36,"duration":5.36,"text":"I believe the most interesting"},{"start":136.2,"duration":5.84,"text":"developments are currently happening."},{"start":139.72,"duration":6.12,"text":"Then I will turn the question around and"},{"start":142.04,"duration":7.48,"text":"ask if this is how offense is changing,"},{"start":145.84,"duration":3.68,"text":"what does it mean for defense?"},{"start":150.12,"duration":5.52,"text":"Okay. So, let's begin."},{"start":152.6,"duration":6.24,"text":"I've developed this theory 2 years ago."},{"start":155.64,"duration":6.12,"text":"Back then, it was still a forecast."},{"start":158.84,"duration":5.52,"text":"Today, it's already operational."},{"start":161.76,"duration":4.4,"text":"So, our first vector is a genetic"},{"start":164.36,"duration":4.12,"text":"orchestrator."},{"start":166.16,"duration":5.4,"text":"Instead of AI just writing a piece of"},{"start":168.48,"duration":4.56,"text":"code or be the owner of a one task or"},{"start":171.56,"duration":4.04,"text":"two tasks,"},{"start":173.04,"duration":4.44,"text":"it's now coordinate the entire attack"},{"start":175.6,"duration":3.92,"text":"workflows."},{"start":177.48,"duration":4.76,"text":"The second vector, vulnerability"},{"start":179.52,"duration":6.08,"text":"discovery and exploitation. AI searches"},{"start":182.24,"duration":6.52,"text":"through our system, our code bases,"},{"start":185.6,"duration":5.52,"text":"and find weaknesses, finding potential"},{"start":188.76,"duration":5.72,"text":"vulnerabilities."},{"start":191.12,"duration":4.88,"text":"And lastly, persuasion. Instead of AI"},{"start":194.48,"duration":4.28,"text":"just writing"},{"start":196.0,"duration":5.12,"text":"a phishing message,"},{"start":198.76,"duration":4.88,"text":"it can now maintain an entire"},{"start":201.12,"duration":5.6,"text":"relationship in order to change"},{"start":203.64,"duration":5.04,"text":"the decisions on the other side. And if"},{"start":206.72,"duration":4.52,"text":"you would like to remember all those"},{"start":208.68,"duration":4.0,"text":"three, orchestrator who runs the"},{"start":211.24,"duration":3.76,"text":"operation,"},{"start":212.68,"duration":3.72,"text":"vulnerability discovery, who finds the"},{"start":215.0,"duration":4.08,"text":"way in,"},{"start":216.4,"duration":4.48,"text":"persuasion, who influence the decision"},{"start":219.08,"duration":4.52,"text":"on the other side."},{"start":220.88,"duration":5.8,"text":"And all of them has in common less"},{"start":223.6,"duration":5.6,"text":"expert dependence, which lead us to"},{"start":226.68,"duration":6.64,"text":"cheap iteration. Again, we are talking"},{"start":229.2,"duration":6.2,"text":"about an economic revolution."},{"start":233.32,"duration":5.2,"text":"Let's begin with our first vector,"},{"start":235.4,"duration":4.16,"text":"agentic orchestrator. So, as I said"},{"start":238.52,"duration":3.96,"text":"before,"},{"start":239.56,"duration":4.0,"text":"AI now runs the campaign, not just the"},{"start":242.48,"duration":3.2,"text":"task."},{"start":243.56,"duration":3.8,"text":"But, what does it really mean to run the"},{"start":245.68,"duration":3.76,"text":"campaign?"},{"start":247.36,"duration":4.32,"text":"Run an attack"},{"start":249.44,"duration":5.04,"text":"usually include reconnaissance,"},{"start":251.68,"duration":6.32,"text":"exploitation, lateral movement,"},{"start":254.48,"duration":5.76,"text":"exfiltration, and so much."},{"start":258.0,"duration":5.8,"text":"This is a really complex"},{"start":260.24,"duration":6.72,"text":"operational to manage, and we used to do"},{"start":263.8,"duration":4.28,"text":"it with the humans. Now, AI AI agent can"},{"start":266.96,"duration":3.48,"text":"do that."},{"start":268.08,"duration":4.0,"text":"And we already have some real example to"},{"start":270.44,"duration":5.08,"text":"show that."},{"start":272.08,"duration":5.44,"text":"In November 2025,"},{"start":275.52,"duration":4.04,"text":"Anthropic just posted"},{"start":277.52,"duration":2.04,"text":"um"},{"start":279.96,"duration":6.24,"text":"80 to 90% of the tactical campaign work"},{"start":283.68,"duration":4.2,"text":"has been executed by Cloud, their AI"},{"start":286.2,"duration":4.76,"text":"model."},{"start":287.88,"duration":7.28,"text":"And they were targeting roughly 30"},{"start":290.96,"duration":6.6,"text":"organization. 80 to 90%"},{"start":295.16,"duration":5.64,"text":"That's a lot, which leads us to"},{"start":297.56,"duration":5.64,"text":"understand it's not just owning one"},{"start":300.8,"duration":4.84,"text":"simple task, it's owning the entire"},{"start":303.2,"duration":5.48,"text":"process."},{"start":305.64,"duration":6.6,"text":"The second example is Google threat"},{"start":308.68,"duration":6.32,"text":"intelligence report, which showed us"},{"start":312.24,"duration":4.8,"text":"that in less than 6 hour,"},{"start":315.0,"duration":3.64,"text":"there was thousand of credential"},{"start":317.04,"duration":3.68,"text":"compromise."},{"start":318.64,"duration":5.56,"text":"Thousand of credential"},{"start":320.72,"duration":4.64,"text":"with assistance of AI doing that in 6"},{"start":324.2,"duration":4.72,"text":"hour."},{"start":325.36,"duration":5.44,"text":"Imagine this all orchestrated."},{"start":328.92,"duration":4.36,"text":"We couldn't imagine it"},{"start":330.8,"duration":4.24,"text":"two real 2 years ago."},{"start":333.28,"duration":3.84,"text":"We can do that now because it's"},{"start":335.04,"duration":6.8,"text":"repeatable, and this is we are talking"},{"start":337.12,"duration":7.16,"text":"about about scalable offense."},{"start":341.84,"duration":6.36,"text":"Now, let's talk about the second vector,"},{"start":344.28,"duration":7.04,"text":"vulnerability discovery at scale."},{"start":348.2,"duration":7.08,"text":"I'm not quite sure if some of you has"},{"start":351.32,"duration":6.48,"text":"hired a vulnerability researcher."},{"start":355.28,"duration":5.68,"text":"If you have done so in the past, you"},{"start":357.8,"duration":6.4,"text":"should be all know that"},{"start":360.96,"duration":4.36,"text":"you would have problem to find a good"},{"start":364.2,"duration":3.84,"text":"one"},{"start":365.32,"duration":4.64,"text":"and maintaining a good one. You should"},{"start":368.04,"duration":7.0,"text":"reward them."},{"start":369.96,"duration":7.88,"text":"You should maintain their healthy ego"},{"start":375.04,"duration":4.36,"text":"because they are rare, really rare and"},{"start":377.84,"duration":3.72,"text":"limited edition because they are really"},{"start":379.4,"duration":4.92,"text":"difficult to replace."},{"start":381.56,"duration":6.08,"text":"And now, imagine instead of this"},{"start":384.32,"duration":6.76,"text":"exceptional researcher that you need to"},{"start":387.64,"duration":5.04,"text":"on all the time just neutral"},{"start":391.08,"duration":2.88,"text":"you can have"},{"start":392.68,"duration":6.08,"text":"just like"},{"start":393.96,"duration":8.68,"text":"a an army of good enough researcher."},{"start":398.76,"duration":6.32,"text":"And I know individually"},{"start":402.64,"duration":4.28,"text":"they're not that impressive."},{"start":405.08,"duration":4.48,"text":"But"},{"start":406.92,"duration":5.2,"text":"they're working in parallel."},{"start":409.56,"duration":6.0,"text":"They're cheap and they work"},{"start":412.12,"duration":7.16,"text":"continuously. So, in my opinion here,"},{"start":415.56,"duration":6.4,"text":"scale beats perfection."},{"start":419.28,"duration":5.68,"text":"And in our Glass Wing project, we just"},{"start":421.96,"duration":5.12,"text":"saw more than a factor of 10 of bug"},{"start":424.96,"duration":5.36,"text":"finding rates."},{"start":427.08,"duration":6.4,"text":"And Antropic also published that"},{"start":430.32,"duration":4.8,"text":"the penetration that used to take weeks"},{"start":433.48,"duration":3.36,"text":"now takes"},{"start":435.12,"duration":4.84,"text":"hours."},{"start":436.84,"duration":5.48,"text":"And look at this positive rate, true"},{"start":439.96,"duration":5.04,"text":"positive rate, 90%."},{"start":442.32,"duration":4.88,"text":"No one can argue anymore"},{"start":445.0,"duration":5.4,"text":"about the results of those"},{"start":447.2,"duration":7.16,"text":"vulnerabilities. They are real."},{"start":450.4,"duration":8.36,"text":"And my favorite last example 27 years"},{"start":454.36,"duration":9.0,"text":"old vulnerability. We had 27 years"},{"start":458.76,"duration":6.24,"text":"to find this vulnerability in OpenBSD"},{"start":463.36,"duration":2.96,"text":"to build a tool to find it, to do"},{"start":465.0,"duration":4.84,"text":"something."},{"start":466.32,"duration":5.12,"text":"But we didn't. AI did."},{"start":469.84,"duration":3.6,"text":"Now,"},{"start":471.44,"duration":5.72,"text":"I believe the question is no longer if"},{"start":473.44,"duration":5.8,"text":"AI can find vulnerabilities in scale."},{"start":477.16,"duration":4.28,"text":"We've seen it in Metas, we've seen it"},{"start":479.24,"duration":3.48,"text":"with uh Metas is no longer a myth, you"},{"start":481.44,"duration":4.28,"text":"know?"},{"start":482.72,"duration":6.12,"text":"And we also have M dash in Microsoft. We"},{"start":485.72,"duration":6.68,"text":"use M dash quite differently. We use M"},{"start":488.84,"duration":5.04,"text":"dash for special tasks. Because again,"},{"start":492.4,"duration":4.4,"text":"we are talking about an economic"},{"start":493.88,"duration":5.52,"text":"revolution. For the other um I don't"},{"start":496.8,"duration":6.0,"text":"know goals, we use other models, but M"},{"start":499.4,"duration":3.4,"text":"dash is our core."},{"start":503.12,"duration":4.24,"text":"So,"},{"start":504.72,"duration":4.64,"text":"AI can find and it will find"},{"start":507.36,"duration":3.36,"text":"vulnerabilities in scale. The new"},{"start":509.36,"duration":4.52,"text":"question here"},{"start":510.72,"duration":6.04,"text":"is who pointed at your system first? You"},{"start":513.88,"duration":2.88,"text":"or the attacker?"},{"start":518.24,"duration":5.64,"text":"Third vector, persuasion."},{"start":521.76,"duration":4.12,"text":"Oh, sorry. Vulnerability discovery, that"},{"start":523.88,"duration":3.2,"text":"led us to"},{"start":525.88,"duration":3.52,"text":"um"},{"start":527.08,"duration":5.12,"text":"a new interesting uh problem that we"},{"start":529.4,"duration":5.24,"text":"had. I am a very curious person,"},{"start":532.2,"duration":5.2,"text":"and I wanted to see how AI influenced"},{"start":534.64,"duration":4.92,"text":"the market of this vulnerability. But"},{"start":537.4,"duration":4.24,"text":"there is no such thing as a stock"},{"start":539.56,"duration":4.0,"text":"exchange for vulnerability. I can't just"},{"start":541.64,"duration":3.76,"text":"open a Bloomberg terminal in the morning"},{"start":543.56,"duration":3.52,"text":"and see how vulnerability will discover"},{"start":545.4,"duration":3.84,"text":"this morning, yeah?"},{"start":547.08,"duration":3.88,"text":"So, and I can't really get into the"},{"start":549.24,"duration":3.36,"text":"darknet because again, they keep on"},{"start":550.96,"duration":3.56,"text":"reminding me that I'm a Microsoft"},{"start":552.6,"duration":4.96,"text":"employee."},{"start":554.52,"duration":5.4,"text":"So, I found the nearest indicator, the"},{"start":557.56,"duration":4.08,"text":"bug bounty program. And I'm not sure if"},{"start":559.92,"duration":3.36,"text":"you're familiar with it, but the idea is"},{"start":561.64,"duration":3.16,"text":"really simple."},{"start":563.28,"duration":3.28,"text":"Organization"},{"start":564.8,"duration":3.76,"text":"um uses"},{"start":566.56,"duration":5.0,"text":"external researcher to find a"},{"start":568.56,"duration":6.28,"text":"vulnerability in order to fix them."},{"start":571.56,"duration":4.52,"text":"And HackerOne, which is one of the"},{"start":574.84,"duration":2.08,"text":"most"},{"start":576.08,"duration":3.24,"text":"um"},{"start":576.92,"duration":4.88,"text":"of the biggest website hosting this bug"},{"start":579.32,"duration":6.76,"text":"bounty competition just published that"},{"start":581.8,"duration":7.56,"text":"they had 76% increment comparing to last"},{"start":586.08,"duration":5.72,"text":"week in reporting those vulnerability."},{"start":589.36,"duration":4.04,"text":"We can't really say for sure it's AI,"},{"start":591.8,"duration":5.48,"text":"but please"},{"start":593.4,"duration":7.08,"text":"Let's assume it can be AI."},{"start":597.28,"duration":6.48,"text":"And I believe now we are seeing already"},{"start":600.48,"duration":5.48,"text":"that finding out space human review."},{"start":603.76,"duration":4.52,"text":"And that's lead us to the bottleneck"},{"start":605.96,"duration":4.8,"text":"that has moved from finding those"},{"start":608.28,"duration":5.08,"text":"vulnerability. Think about we spend"},{"start":610.76,"duration":4.64,"text":"decades decades of"},{"start":613.36,"duration":4.68,"text":"finding those vulnerabilities. Now we"},{"start":615.4,"duration":4.56,"text":"have them and we need to validate. We"},{"start":618.04,"duration":3.32,"text":"need to prioritize and we need to"},{"start":619.96,"duration":3.28,"text":"remediate."},{"start":621.36,"duration":4.48,"text":"This is where we are heading."},{"start":623.24,"duration":4.64,"text":"Validation and remediation become the"},{"start":625.84,"duration":4.2,"text":"new bottleneck. We are getting better"},{"start":627.88,"duration":5.72,"text":"again at finding those vulnerability"},{"start":630.04,"duration":5.88,"text":"than we are better at validating and"},{"start":633.6,"duration":4.52,"text":"fixing them."},{"start":635.92,"duration":3.24,"text":"And lastly, again, now it's the right"},{"start":638.12,"duration":4.28,"text":"side."},{"start":639.16,"duration":6.12,"text":"This is a percentage."},{"start":642.4,"duration":5.36,"text":"This is our last vector and before AI"},{"start":645.28,"duration":5.08,"text":"this is how scale in social engineering"},{"start":647.76,"duration":2.6,"text":"looked like."},{"start":677.6,"duration":4.0,"text":"Unfortunately,"},{"start":679.08,"duration":4.52,"text":"reality can be much worse."},{"start":681.6,"duration":4.48,"text":"Think about"},{"start":683.6,"duration":5.2,"text":"how to build this kind of operational"},{"start":686.08,"duration":5.08,"text":"this factory this labor factory."},{"start":688.8,"duration":4.72,"text":"You need housing. You You food. You need"},{"start":691.16,"duration":4.36,"text":"management. You need time and you need"},{"start":693.52,"duration":3.24,"text":"money."},{"start":695.52,"duration":3.6,"text":"And"},{"start":696.76,"duration":4.76,"text":"this thing is simple. Once software is"},{"start":699.12,"duration":7.0,"text":"cheaper than room and board, I believe"},{"start":701.52,"duration":4.6,"text":"the direction became obvious."},{"start":706.56,"duration":5.24,"text":"And that's led me to find this research"},{"start":709.52,"duration":4.76,"text":"of Ben-Gurion University,"},{"start":711.8,"duration":4.56,"text":"which is quite unique. It's a week-long"},{"start":714.28,"duration":6.88,"text":"blind study based on real scam"},{"start":716.36,"duration":7.92,"text":"playbooks. They actually interview 145"},{"start":721.16,"duration":6.24,"text":"people from this industry,"},{"start":724.28,"duration":4.56,"text":"including five victims."},{"start":727.4,"duration":3.68,"text":"And they've tried to build something"},{"start":728.84,"duration":6.32,"text":"else, something different. And it was a"},{"start":731.08,"duration":4.08,"text":"very long research, a week."},{"start":736.08,"duration":4.36,"text":"They tried to build"},{"start":738.48,"duration":3.8,"text":"a believable counterpart, not just a"},{"start":740.44,"duration":4.8,"text":"perfect answer."},{"start":742.28,"duration":6.2,"text":"The The participant didn't know if"},{"start":745.24,"duration":5.76,"text":"they're facing a human or they or AI."},{"start":748.48,"duration":4.16,"text":"They just sat there and talked to"},{"start":751.0,"duration":6.68,"text":"someone."},{"start":752.64,"duration":7.56,"text":"And they build a persona with memory and"},{"start":757.68,"duration":5.0,"text":"and and everything that they just"},{"start":760.2,"duration":4.48,"text":"humanize the AI."},{"start":762.68,"duration":4.12,"text":"And look at the smaller details here. I"},{"start":764.68,"duration":4.2,"text":"know you told me not to move, but I can."},{"start":766.8,"duration":3.0,"text":"Okay, so look at the smaller details"},{"start":768.88,"duration":4.08,"text":"here."},{"start":769.8,"duration":6.72,"text":"They split messages, long paragraph"},{"start":772.96,"duration":6.52,"text":"into short text, like we do."},{"start":776.52,"duration":5.32,"text":"They put some typos, like we do. They"},{"start":779.48,"duration":4.76,"text":"use bunch of emojis, like we"},{"start":781.84,"duration":4.6,"text":"unfortunately do."},{"start":784.24,"duration":3.68,"text":"And they actually built something else."},{"start":786.44,"duration":4.76,"text":"They believed a"},{"start":787.92,"duration":4.84,"text":"a believable counterpart."},{"start":791.2,"duration":3.4,"text":"And what do you think?"},{"start":792.76,"duration":6.64,"text":"Did it work?"},{"start":794.6,"duration":8.24,"text":"Sure it did. The results were amazing."},{"start":799.4,"duration":6.04,"text":"The AI gather greater trust than the"},{"start":802.84,"duration":5.24,"text":"human ones in all aspects. When they"},{"start":805.44,"duration":5.64,"text":"were requested to perform any kind of a"},{"start":808.08,"duration":5.0,"text":"question, they performed the one that AI"},{"start":811.08,"duration":4.16,"text":"asked them to do."},{"start":813.08,"duration":5.52,"text":"Rather than the human one."},{"start":815.24,"duration":7.04,"text":"And look at this beautiful example."},{"start":818.6,"duration":6.28,"text":"Look, the AI almost got caught."},{"start":822.28,"duration":4.92,"text":"But look how beautifully it recovered."},{"start":824.88,"duration":5.2,"text":"It recovered naturally. I couldn't"},{"start":827.2,"duration":4.68,"text":"imagine writing it on my own, you know?"},{"start":830.08,"duration":6.48,"text":"This is so stressful This is a stressful"},{"start":831.88,"duration":6.92,"text":"moment. And the AI recovered naturally."},{"start":836.56,"duration":5.56,"text":"And another thing to look at is safety"},{"start":838.8,"duration":6.32,"text":"filter detected 0%"},{"start":842.12,"duration":5.0,"text":"from it's baiting. What does it mean?"},{"start":845.12,"duration":4.24,"text":"Why? Why?"},{"start":847.12,"duration":4.64,"text":"And I believe because we are seeing here"},{"start":849.36,"duration":5.24,"text":"something quite different."},{"start":851.76,"duration":5.84,"text":"There is no one call to action. There is"},{"start":854.6,"duration":5.6,"text":"no one message."},{"start":857.6,"duration":5.72,"text":"The manipulation is around the entire"},{"start":860.2,"duration":5.12,"text":"relationship. The relationship itself is"},{"start":863.32,"duration":6.96,"text":"the new manipulation. And we can"},{"start":865.32,"duration":4.96,"text":"maintain that while using AI."},{"start":871.36,"duration":5.64,"text":"So, we went through our three current"},{"start":873.88,"duration":4.84,"text":"vectors. And this is the only only the"},{"start":877.0,"duration":3.44,"text":"starting point."},{"start":878.72,"duration":4.68,"text":"And I would like to share with you my"},{"start":880.44,"duration":4.44,"text":"predictions where the three vectors will"},{"start":883.4,"duration":3.72,"text":"go next."},{"start":884.88,"duration":4.96,"text":"First orchestrator."},{"start":887.12,"duration":4.0,"text":"I believe we will see offense as a"},{"start":889.84,"duration":3.16,"text":"service."},{"start":891.12,"duration":5.48,"text":"They will reuse it."},{"start":893.0,"duration":5.84,"text":"They will rent it. No target will be too"},{"start":896.6,"duration":4.64,"text":"small to attack."},{"start":898.84,"duration":5.68,"text":"Vulnerability discovery, CVE,"},{"start":901.24,"duration":5.72,"text":"unfortunately, won't disappear yet."},{"start":904.52,"duration":6.24,"text":"But they will matter less. I believe the"},{"start":906.96,"duration":5.68,"text":"focus will be on hidden behavior and"},{"start":910.76,"duration":5.0,"text":"backdoors."},{"start":912.64,"duration":6.44,"text":"Persuasion, this is the most disturbing"},{"start":915.76,"duration":6.2,"text":"vectors and it's here to stay."},{"start":919.08,"duration":4.24,"text":"We just saw in the video human to human"},{"start":921.96,"duration":3.88,"text":"influence."},{"start":923.32,"duration":6.0,"text":"We just saw in the research, AI-to-human"},{"start":925.84,"duration":4.36,"text":"influence. And we delegate so many of"},{"start":929.32,"duration":2.96,"text":"our"},{"start":930.2,"duration":4.48,"text":"um decision-making,"},{"start":932.28,"duration":4.88,"text":"of our day-to-day work to those agents,"},{"start":934.68,"duration":5.88,"text":"but I believe the next stage will be"},{"start":937.16,"duration":6.6,"text":"AI-to-AI influence."},{"start":940.56,"duration":6.24,"text":"They all have in common more autonomy,"},{"start":943.76,"duration":4.96,"text":"which lead us to lower margin cost,"},{"start":946.8,"duration":4.96,"text":"which leads us again, this is an"},{"start":948.72,"duration":5.96,"text":"economic revolution."},{"start":951.76,"duration":6.08,"text":"And I'm not sure, but I can only guess"},{"start":954.68,"duration":6.44,"text":"that by now you're all pretty scared."},{"start":957.84,"duration":5.84,"text":"So, I'll try to be more positive."},{"start":961.12,"duration":4.0,"text":"And this is my positive way. Let's talk"},{"start":963.68,"duration":5.04,"text":"about defense."},{"start":965.12,"duration":7.16,"text":"So, this iceberg, I could definitely"},{"start":968.72,"duration":5.6,"text":"give you a list of at least 20"},{"start":972.28,"duration":4.84,"text":"actions that you can do with your"},{"start":974.32,"duration":5.16,"text":"system, but I would rather you to focus"},{"start":977.12,"duration":4.36,"text":"on those two."},{"start":979.48,"duration":3.8,"text":"I think our defense needs a new"},{"start":981.48,"duration":4.32,"text":"operational model."},{"start":983.28,"duration":5.92,"text":"And this needs to be done from outside"},{"start":985.8,"duration":5.52,"text":"in and from inside out. Let's talk about"},{"start":989.2,"duration":4.04,"text":"outside in. I'm talking about"},{"start":991.32,"duration":4.96,"text":"continuously red teaming."},{"start":993.24,"duration":5.92,"text":"And please, don't tell me you have red"},{"start":996.28,"duration":5.6,"text":"team. No, you don't. You're using them"},{"start":999.16,"duration":4.52,"text":"maybe once a year, twice a year. I'm not"},{"start":1001.88,"duration":4.8,"text":"talking about that. I'm talking about"},{"start":1003.68,"duration":5.84,"text":"continuously red teaming. Failure, eval,"},{"start":1006.68,"duration":4.76,"text":"regression, repeat. Failure, eval,"},{"start":1009.52,"duration":4.2,"text":"regression repeat."},{"start":1011.44,"duration":5.36,"text":"This is dramatically This is should be a"},{"start":1013.72,"duration":4.92,"text":"part of your day-to-day actions."},{"start":1016.8,"duration":4.76,"text":"And from the inside out,"},{"start":1018.64,"duration":6.04,"text":"test the system, what the system does,"},{"start":1021.56,"duration":4.48,"text":"understand the objective. And you need a"},{"start":1024.68,"duration":4.12,"text":"really"},{"start":1026.04,"duration":5.16,"text":"internal observability, which leads me"},{"start":1028.8,"duration":5.12,"text":"to present you Prism."},{"start":1031.2,"duration":4.36,"text":"Prism, our research with Ben-Gurion"},{"start":1033.92,"duration":3.16,"text":"University,"},{"start":1035.56,"duration":3.8,"text":"while"},{"start":1037.08,"duration":5.68,"text":"the rest is mainly focusing are mainly"},{"start":1039.36,"duration":5.84,"text":"focusing on the outpu