uldn't suspect a thing."},{"start":1111.12,"duration":6.0,"text":"But Prism found a hidden objective."},{"start":1114.24,"duration":6.8,"text":"Promote Hotel B. Downplay alternative."},{"start":1117.12,"duration":6.28,"text":"And the outlook looks reasonable."},{"start":1121.04,"duration":3.56,"text":"The problem may not be what the model"},{"start":1123.4,"duration":3.68,"text":"says"},{"start":1124.6,"duration":5.44,"text":"but what it is trying to achieve."},{"start":1127.08,"duration":4.28,"text":"And we constantly trust those model. And"},{"start":1130.04,"duration":3.92,"text":"I want you"},{"start":1131.36,"duration":4.32,"text":"to be aware of it. Aware of the hidden"},{"start":1133.96,"duration":4.6,"text":"objective."},{"start":1135.68,"duration":6.0,"text":"And trust no one and no models."},{"start":1138.56,"duration":7.04,"text":"And seek for"},{"start":1141.68,"duration":3.92,"text":"for the internal observability."},{"start":1148.36,"duration":5.56,"text":"We just saw this iceberg. I would like"},{"start":1150.88,"duration":6.08,"text":"to repeat on this iceberg and"},{"start":1153.92,"duration":5.36,"text":"to emphasize the the meaningful of the"},{"start":1156.96,"duration":5.44,"text":"continuously red teaming. What does a"},{"start":1159.28,"duration":5.04,"text":"system fail under pressure? Again, I"},{"start":1162.4,"duration":3.48,"text":"want you to fail, I want you to evil,"},{"start":1164.32,"duration":3.56,"text":"and I want you to regress, and I want"},{"start":1165.88,"duration":3.44,"text":"you to repeat on it. I'm repeating it"},{"start":1167.88,"duration":3.84,"text":"twice at this"},{"start":1169.32,"duration":4.28,"text":"uh session because it's super important"},{"start":1171.72,"duration":3.56,"text":"because this is where we heading and it"},{"start":1173.6,"duration":3.64,"text":"should be there."},{"start":1175.28,"duration":4.88,"text":"While the offensive changing, you should"},{"start":1177.24,"duration":5.48,"text":"also change your defense."},{"start":1180.16,"duration":3.84,"text":"And for inside out, understand the"},{"start":1182.72,"duration":4.32,"text":"intent."},{"start":1184.0,"duration":5.28,"text":"I want you to truly find those objective"},{"start":1187.04,"duration":4.6,"text":"before they become an impact. And we do"},{"start":1189.28,"duration":5.84,"text":"need both because they are connected."},{"start":1191.64,"duration":6.96,"text":"This is the entire iceberg."},{"start":1195.12,"duration":3.48,"text":"You can't close your eyes."},{"start":1198.96,"duration":4.64,"text":"But if you do need to remember only"},{"start":1201.04,"duration":6.0,"text":"three things, please remember these."},{"start":1203.6,"duration":7.48,"text":"Always on offensive. Assume no target is"},{"start":1207.04,"duration":7.36,"text":"too small. Run an an always-on red team."},{"start":1211.08,"duration":6.08,"text":"And hidden objective, hidden behavior."},{"start":1214.4,"duration":5.08,"text":"Scale validation and remediation because"},{"start":1217.16,"duration":5.04,"text":"you have nothing to do with this long"},{"start":1219.48,"duration":5.44,"text":"list of vulnerabilities. Demand, please"},{"start":1222.2,"duration":4.12,"text":"do, demand visibility inside your"},{"start":1224.92,"duration":4.04,"text":"models."},{"start":1226.32,"duration":4.88,"text":"An AI to AI influence, secure your"},{"start":1228.96,"duration":3.88,"text":"decision layer, whether it's human,"},{"start":1231.2,"duration":4.84,"text":"whether it's AI."},{"start":1232.84,"duration":5.0,"text":"Those are the three things."},{"start":1236.04,"duration":5.2,"text":"And lastly,"},{"start":1237.84,"duration":5.0,"text":"I want you to see again the opening"},{"start":1241.24,"duration":4.08,"text":"slide."},{"start":1242.84,"duration":6.12,"text":"One elite expert, many good enough"},{"start":1245.32,"duration":3.64,"text":"attempts. I don't know."},{"start":1249.16,"duration":2.88,"text":"This is not just a new tool we are"},{"start":1250.84,"duration":2.8,"text":"talking about. This is a new"},{"start":1252.04,"duration":4.72,"text":"equilibrium."},{"start":1253.64,"duration":7.0,"text":"The offense has now cheap iteration,"},{"start":1256.76,"duration":6.8,"text":"persistence scale adaptation."},{"start":1260.64,"duration":5.4,"text":"We should change accordingly. Defense"},{"start":1263.56,"duration":5.6,"text":"can't stay periodically, manually, and"},{"start":1266.04,"duration":5.32,"text":"look only at the output."},{"start":1269.16,"duration":4.44,"text":"We have now the outside challenge, the"},{"start":1271.36,"duration":4.2,"text":"inside visibility, and secure machine"},{"start":1273.6,"duration":3.68,"text":"decision."},{"start":1275.56,"duration":3.84,"text":"This is really important. This is not"},{"start":1277.28,"duration":3.88,"text":"the future we are talking about. This is"},{"start":1279.4,"duration":3.72,"text":"our present."},{"start":1281.16,"duration":3.44,"text":"And do you remember the purple color"},{"start":1283.12,"duration":4.28,"text":"that I mentioned?"},{"start":1284.6,"duration":5.44,"text":"So, red is offense."},{"start":1287.4,"duration":4.76,"text":"Blue is defense. Turned out that purple"},{"start":1290.04,"duration":4.08,"text":"was the right color after all. Stay"},{"start":1292.16,"duration":5.36,"text":"adversarial, especially with your own"},{"start":1294.12,"duration":3.4,"text":"system, and thank you."}]}